    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO UFL \u2014 THE FREE-TO-PLAY FOOTBALL SIMULATION WHERE FAIR PLAY REIGNS SUPREME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play UFL and relish your journey to the top of the global online football league. Build your squad from thousands of real-life footballers, compete against players from around the world, grow your club, take part in in-game events and earn exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join. Play. Win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/88ae520db48d6d1c1e88195698db9479.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/88ae520db48d6d1c1e88195698db9479.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/88ae520db48d6d1c1e88195698db9479.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BRAND NEW FOOTBALL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by true football sim fans, UFL features a global ranked league, rich metagame, advanced AI and player animation systems. Its streamlined UX lets you jump straight into the action and enjoy the beautiful game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/61a8e779cf218e4aac7551345c1e21d8.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/61a8e779cf218e4aac7551345c1e21d8.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/61a8e779cf218e4aac7551345c1e21d8.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIGN REAL PLAYERS ON THE TRANSFER MARKET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of who joins your squad. All players in UFL are real, and their stats dynamically reflect their real-world form. Scout the transfer market, sign footballers and build your dream team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/efe7d682b9f8c43e1b54d761be9942fa.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/efe7d682b9f8c43e1b54d761be9942fa.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/efe7d682b9f8c43e1b54d761be9942fa.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> UNIQUE WAYS TO DEVELOP YOUR PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn in-game resources from matches and upgrade your squad. A flexible progression system with customisable skills lets you craft a truly unique team tailored to your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/2e9f7a0d26d2b197af92ae0048439f1c.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/2e9f7a0d26d2b197af92ae0048439f1c.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/2e9f7a0d26d2b197af92ae0048439f1c.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES FOR EVERY MOOD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP</strong> \u2014 test your skills against real opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE</strong> \u2014 train and grow your squad at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch co-op</strong> \u2014 play with friends and enjoy the game together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/a7077353859b2204e6919067118f5857.avif?t=1751972697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/9d74e28389a68d14fedf2f2b11c99126.avif?t=1751972697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>UNIQUE CARD SKIN SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up your squad by collecting special card skins with different rarities and traits. Make your club\u2019s style truly one of a kind. Take part in events and earn rare skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/973ebf8e5093a287788e5eac86c2d471.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/973ebf8e5093a287788e5eac86c2d471.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/973ebf8e5093a287788e5eac86c2d471.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A VARIETY OF IN-GAME EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seasonal Team Passes, regular challenges, community events, and brand-new player card skin sets, UFL keeps the excitement coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t want to miss any of our events, especially special occasions like the <strong>Dragonborn Team Pass. </strong>These events are a great way to dramatically transform your team\u2019s style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/7af98ae2b55f094436dbf47257e08e6e.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/7af98ae2b55f094436dbf47257e08e6e.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/7af98ae2b55f094436dbf47257e08e6e.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>CONSTANT EVOLUTION IN REAL TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFL is always evolving. With frequent updates, fresh content, new game modes, and gameplay improvements shaped by community feedback, we\u2019re building the future of UFL together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/5768077f5477fcc3a44be34473bf310c.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/5768077f5477fcc3a44be34473bf310c.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/5768077f5477fcc3a44be34473bf310c.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO RESTARTS. PROGRESS THAT LASTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your club and your achievements are here to stay. No annual resets \u2014 your progress is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/ae0c52d33ba800950d3b3bc2096f41ae.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/ae0c52d33ba800950d3b3bc2096f41ae.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/ae0c52d33ba800950d3b3bc2096f41ae.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELIABLE ONLINE PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All matches run on dedicated servers. Stability is our top priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/1b05c62666a23957c8098b3c454fd7ea.avif?t=1751972697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROLLERS? ABSOLUTELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with mouse and keyboard or your favorite gamepad. PlayStation and Xbox controllers are supported out of the box. No setup required \u2014 just plug in and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO UFL \u2014 THE FREE-TO-PLAY FOOTBALL SIMULATION WHERE FAIR PLAY REIGNS SUPREME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play UFL and relish your journey to the top of the global online football league. Build your squad from thousands of real-life footballers, compete against players from around the world, grow your club, take part in in-game events and earn exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join. Play. Win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/88ae520db48d6d1c1e88195698db9479.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/88ae520db48d6d1c1e88195698db9479.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/88ae520db48d6d1c1e88195698db9479.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BRAND NEW FOOTBALL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by true football sim fans, UFL features a global ranked league, rich metagame, advanced AI and player animation systems. Its streamlined UX lets you jump straight into the action and enjoy the beautiful game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/61a8e779cf218e4aac7551345c1e21d8.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/61a8e779cf218e4aac7551345c1e21d8.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/61a8e779cf218e4aac7551345c1e21d8.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIGN REAL PLAYERS ON THE TRANSFER MARKET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of who joins your squad. All players in UFL are real, and their stats dynamically reflect their real-world form. Scout the transfer market, sign footballers and build your dream team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/efe7d682b9f8c43e1b54d761be9942fa.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/efe7d682b9f8c43e1b54d761be9942fa.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/efe7d682b9f8c43e1b54d761be9942fa.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> UNIQUE WAYS TO DEVELOP YOUR PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn in-game resources from matches and upgrade your squad. A flexible progression system with customisable skills lets you craft a truly unique team tailored to your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/2e9f7a0d26d2b197af92ae0048439f1c.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/2e9f7a0d26d2b197af92ae0048439f1c.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/2e9f7a0d26d2b197af92ae0048439f1c.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES FOR EVERY MOOD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP</strong> \u2014 test your skills against real opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE</strong> \u2014 train and grow your squad at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch co-op</strong> \u2014 play with friends and enjoy the game together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/a7077353859b2204e6919067118f5857.avif?t=1751972697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/9d74e28389a68d14fedf2f2b11c99126.avif?t=1751972697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>UNIQUE CARD SKIN SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up your squad by collecting special card skins with different rarities and traits. Make your club\u2019s style truly one of a kind. Take part in events and earn rare skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/973ebf8e5093a287788e5eac86c2d471.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/973ebf8e5093a287788e5eac86c2d471.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/973ebf8e5093a287788e5eac86c2d471.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A VARIETY OF IN-GAME EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seasonal Team Passes, regular challenges, community events, and brand-new player card skin sets, UFL keeps the excitement coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t want to miss any of our events, especially special occasions like the <strong>Dragonborn Team Pass. </strong>These events are a great way to dramatically transform your team\u2019s style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/7af98ae2b55f094436dbf47257e08e6e.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/7af98ae2b55f094436dbf47257e08e6e.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/7af98ae2b55f094436dbf47257e08e6e.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>CONSTANT EVOLUTION IN REAL TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFL is always evolving. With frequent updates, fresh content, new game modes, and gameplay improvements shaped by community feedback, we\u2019re building the future of UFL together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/5768077f5477fcc3a44be34473bf310c.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/5768077f5477fcc3a44be34473bf310c.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/5768077f5477fcc3a44be34473bf310c.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO RESTARTS. PROGRESS THAT LASTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your club and your achievements are here to stay. No annual resets \u2014 your progress is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/ae0c52d33ba800950d3b3bc2096f41ae.poster.avif?t=1751972697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/ae0c52d33ba800950d3b3bc2096f41ae.webm?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/ae0c52d33ba800950d3b3bc2096f41ae.mp4?t=1751972697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELIABLE ONLINE PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All matches run on dedicated servers. Stability is our top priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023930/extras/1b05c62666a23957c8098b3c454fd7ea.avif?t=1751972697\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROLLERS? ABSOLUTELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with mouse and keyboard or your favorite gamepad. PlayStation and Xbox controllers are supported out of the box. No setup required \u2014 just plug in and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
